WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.152
Numeric values stored as text need conversion before reliable numerical analysis.

00:00:06.152 --> 00:00:11.217
The amount column contains “45”, “72”, “missing”, and “91”.

00:00:11.217 --> 00:00:15.872
Pd dot to_numeric attempts to convert them.

00:00:15.872 --> 00:00:24.986
Errors equals coerce turns anything that cannot be converted into NaN instead of raising an exception.

00:00:25.461 --> 00:00:30.643
After conversion, the word “missing” becomes a missing numeric value.

00:00:30.643 --> 00:00:36.528
That makes the problem visible and lets us handle it using standard missing-data tools.
